{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-95","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与比例","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a fifth apotome, the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":95,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.95","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.95/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":95,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","contentId":"euclid-10-95","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"624aa5662ff0247ec35ba8dcf83fe415ebc9e72905d3efae9b9e67e2072b76bb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-95.statement","euclid-10-95.construction.1","euclid-10-95.construction.2","euclid-10-95.proof.1","euclid-10-95.construction.3","euclid-10-95.proof.2","euclid-10-95.proof.3","euclid-10-95.proof.4","euclid-10-95.construction.4","euclid-10-95.proof.5","euclid-10-95.proof.6","euclid-10-95.proof.7","euclid-10-95.proof.8","euclid-10-95.proof.9","euclid-10-95.proof.10","euclid-10-95.conclusion","euclid-10-95.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-95.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d7ac88f39231d42577d66b13a152beb84143ca799f5dd2faecf9a8d1ae85242","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a fifth apotome, the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第五截差无理线段组成,则区域一侧为直线,产生有理面积个整数中项无理线段个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9adad72b40078533443c53a76afaaebaf359ce2be872f99d587ee0564c810954","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the fifth apotome AD; I say that the side of the area AB is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB区由有理线段 AC和5 截差无理线段 AD组成;我说,AB区是一条直线,有理面积 a 中项无理线段整条。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d205aeefab3e19f4a33fab013d87b7f22cce093fbbcffd8047da3bcbfbb0416","citations":["euclid-10-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DG be the annex to AD; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the annex GD is commensurable in length with the rational straight line AC set out, and the square on the whole AG is greater than the square on the annex DG by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AG. [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG是AD的附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,GD是长度可公度,有理线段 AC是有理线段 AC,正方形是整个附件DG,正方形是正方形,不可公度直线上AG。 [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a121047b3cf4f670d84c86854f498f30dab6a54a978f09aeb51468f9aac626a5","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on DG and deficient by a square figure, it will divide it into incommensurable parts. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对AG a 平行四边形适用相当于正方形的第四部分,即DG,且有正方形个数字不足,则分为不可公度个部分。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e5017686055f25b01a6619241c09cb581e4134dfc93300f304e0be6e3a30577","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then DG be bisected at the point E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG; therefore AF is incommensurable in length with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG在E点被分成两部分,EG对AGa 平行四边形适用,相当于正方形,但有正方形数字不足,矩形、AF、FG则适用,因此AF为不可公度,FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f321c0ba36e16b721026872f6dc5cc516f3616fca6d26b2abae1f278f792c8d","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AG is incommensurable in length with CA, and both are rational, therefore AK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AG长不可公度,CA, 两者均为有理,AK长中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69cea940a77634748c8a4ad403c439260b44e180828d239e743ce5b9a48780bd","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DG is rational and commensurable in length with AC, DK is rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DG是有理,长度可公度是AC,DK是有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2115749f86afc217228b9c167b7b4a4aa2871491e20b3c3f614c469e81de9a0e","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square LM be constructed equal to AI, and let the square NO equal to FK and about the same angle, the angle LPM, be subtracted; therefore the squares LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,正方形 LM建房等于AI,正方形 NO建房等于FK,而同一角度,即角度LPM,则要减去;因此,正方形 LM建房等于NO,直径大致相同。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d15056c914d47d0ad44383ecbe413b7bd54d85debc90f10979bd10471aebcaa6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly then we can prove that LN is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明LN是AB区的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb38a862e142353d8735640d3f1e7b4725b332a793f5955f9c1ab5e074ff9580","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that LN is the straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说LN是直线 产生有理面积 a 中项无理线段整条"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"551a739a88ea04b4479dda0bfa3f0e9ed45db5cf0ab2a3b765e155fce969cd28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AK was proved medial and is equal to the squares on LP, PN, therefore the sum of the squares on LP, PN is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AK项被证明为中项无理线段项,相当于LP项对LP项对PN项,因此,LP项对LP项对PN项对中项无理线段项对中项无理线段项对中项无理线段项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb439836e4b89ca69b576ea7b3f497addcacb5904bc8c35d7936e63bf4f02ab9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DK is rational and is equal to twice the rectangle LP, PN, the latter is itself also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DK为有理,相当于矩形 LP的两倍,PN,后者本身也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb426a80d6f829ecae5cbbe194129cdb58379d26e469c2f62852b0b0808dc5f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AI is incommensurable with FK, therefore the square on LP is also incommensurable with the square on PN; therefore LP, PN are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial but twice the rectangle contained by them rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AI是不可公度,FK,LP是正方形,也是不可公度,PN是正方形,矩形是正方形,矩形是正方形,正方形是正方形,正方形的直线,正方形是正方形,中项无理线段,正方形的总数是正方形,但是有理的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d27a5f2f9a958ec0760f34d2bcdcc01e6a01440ed4f12e6589780e9b01b89612","citations":["euclid-10-77"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remainder LN is the irrational straight line called that which produces with a rational area a medial whole; [[X. 77](/principles/euclid-10-77)] and it is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的LN是无理线段,即有理面积 a 中项无理线段整件的产物;它是AB区的一面。 [[X. 77](/principles/euclid-10-77)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe9b4dc90580a7b8eee65abc86cff746747f463ebd28c18887d6158adc62c706","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area AB is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB区一侧是一条直线,总产值为有理面积a 中项无理线段整数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-95.source","contentId":"euclid-10-95","revisionId":"euclid-10-95@raw-624aa5662ff0247e","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5acb35be708343b7966bdc67d91c641706db2c59f0e31c9576f633c35892238a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.95/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.95\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-95:euclid-10-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-95","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-95.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_refer